<BaseLayout
  title="Authors"
  description="The editor behind Sourcedreviews."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <header>
      <h1>Authors</h1>
      <p class="summary">The single person with editorial authority over Sourcedreviews.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>Daniel Reeves — Editor</h2>
    <p>Daniel has been writing about consumer products since 2019. He curates the reviews on Sourcedreviews by drawing on published testing from independent labs, manufacturer specifications, and aggregated verified-buyer feedback.</p>
    <p>Daniel does not perform hands-on testing of every product reviewed on this site; for the full editorial process, see <a href="/our-method/">Our Method</a>.</p>
    <p>Daniel can be reached at <a href="mailto:contact@sourcedreviews.com">contact@sourcedreviews.com</a> for editorial inquiries, corrections, and takedown requests.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>